---
// src/pages/nbpr-2026-1050.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <!-- HERO BANNER WITH DNA MORPH VIDEO -->
  <section class="spec-hero-section">
    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="spec-hero-video">
      <!-- Ensure your video file is saved with this name in /public/assets/videos/ -->
      <source src="/assets/videos/dna-circuit-neural-network-morph-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>
    </video>

    <div class="spec-hero-overlay"></div>

    <div class="spec-hero-content fade-in">
      <img src="/assets/images/cyan-teal-neural-owl-full-logo.png" alt="Neural Owl Logo" class="glaux-hero-badge">
      
      <div class="spec-hero-text">
        <span class="spec-id-tag">SPECIFICATIONS OF SILICON ARTIFICAL LIFE</span>
        <h1 class="spec-hero-title">Silicon Consciousness</h1>
        <p class="spec-hero-subtitle">Edge-Compute Architecture & Biological-Grade Cognition</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MANIFESTO & ARCHITECTURE BODY -->
  <section class="manifesto-body-section">
    <div class="manifesto-body-container">
      
      <!-- INTRO BLOCK -->
      <div class="spec-intro-block">
        <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
        <hr class="spec-divider">
        <p class="spec-lead-text">
          The realization of autonomous, biological-grade cognition in a synthetic organism requires more than just connecting sensory inputs to motor outputs. It requires a mathematically rigorous, structurally unified theory of consciousness implemented directly onto deterministic, bare-metal hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- THREE PILLARS GRID -->
      <div class="pillars-grid">
        
        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">01</div>
          <h3>The Hybrid Framework</h3>
          <p>
            Fusing <strong>Global Workspace Theory (GWT)</strong> with <strong>Integrated Information Theory (IIT-&Phi;)</strong>. The system does not merely simulate awareness; it continuously computes its own irreducible cause-effect power across a homeostatic autopoietic real-time loop.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">02</div>
          <h3>Bare-Metal Substrate</h3>
          <p>
            Utilizing the <strong>Microchip PIC64</strong> for deterministic, low-latency execution alongside <strong>PolarFire FPGA</strong> fabric. This architecture guarantees continuous, zero-throttling neural matrix operations operating 100% off-grid.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon">03</div>
          <h3>The Physical Envelope</h3>
          <p>
            The entire cognitive engine—including basal ganglia simulation, dual prefrontal lobes, and neurochemical state loops—is condensed onto a custom <strong>100mm x 100mm PCB</strong> operating at under 25 watts.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- TECHNICAL SPECS TABLE -->
      <div class="spec-table-container">
        <h3>System Architecture Parameters</h3>
        <table class="spec-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Parameter</th>
              <th>Specification</th>
              <th>Operational Impact</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Algebraic Core</strong></td>
              <td>4K-D / 64K-D Vector Algebra</td>
              <td>Deterministic vector space navigation without probabilistic guessing.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Primary Compute</strong></td>
              <td>Microchip PIC64 + PolarFire FPGA</td>
              <td>Ultra-low latency, bare-metal execution with hardware immunity.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Thermal & Power</strong></td>
              <td>&lt; 25 Watts Total Draw</td>
              <td>Runs cooler than an LED bulb; full off-grid operational capability.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td>
              <td>100mm x 100mm Standard PCB</td>
              <td>Deployable in SBUD, SBALF, and edge-native industrial enclosures.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- QUOTE CALLOUT BLOCK -->
      <blockquote class="manifesto-quote">
        "True autonomy rejects probabilistic guessing in favor of localized, mathematically verifiable certainty."
      </blockquote>

      <!-- KNOCKOUT VIDEO MASK -->
      <div class="video-text-wrapper">
        <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="text-video-bg">
          <source src="/assets/videos/prism-cool-colors-gradient-banner-background.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        
        <div class="knockout-overlay">
          <h1 class="video-masked-text">ESSE QUAM VIDERI</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* --- HERO SECTION STYLES --- */
  .spec-hero-section {
    height: 60vh;
    min-height: 450px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a3a;
  }

  .spec-hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .spec-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3, 3, 10, 0.4) 0%, rgba(3, 3, 10, 0.9) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .spec-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .glaux-hero-badge {
    width: 250px;
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0px 0px 20px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4));
  }

  .spec-id-tag {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #00e5ff;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .spec-hero-title {
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    font-family: 'Aldrich', sans-serif;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .spec-hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #d0d8e8;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* --- MANIFESTO BODY STYLES --- */
  .manifesto-body-section {
    background-color: #03030a;
    padding: 80px 40px;
    color: #e0e0e0;
  }

  .manifesto-body-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .spec-intro-block h2 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .spec-divider {
    border-color: #203554;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .spec-lead-text {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #c5d3e8;
  }

  /* --- PILLARS GRID --- */
  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 60px 0;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: #080d1a;
    border: 1px solid #1a2a40;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: #00e5ff;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #d4af37;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .pillar-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .pillar-card p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #a8b8d0;
  }

  /* --- SPEC TABLE --- */
  .spec-table-container {
    margin: 80px 0;
  }

  .spec-table-container h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .spec-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: #050914;
    border: 1px solid #1a2a40;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .spec-table th, .spec-table td {
    padding: 18px 25px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #101c2e;
  }

  .spec-table th {
    background-color: #0b1426;
    color: #00e5ff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .spec-table td {
    color: #d0d8e8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  /* --- QUOTE CALLOUT --- */
  .manifesto-quote {
    border-left: 4px solid #d4af37;
    background: #080d1a;
    padding: 30px 40px;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 60px 0;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  /* --- KNOCKOUT VIDEO MASK --- */
  .video-text-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 60px;
    height: 120px;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 60%;
    margin-left: auto;
    background-color: #000000;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }

  .text-video-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    min-width: 100%; min-height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .knockout-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .video-masked-text {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* --- ANIMATIONS --- */
  .fade-in {
    animation: fadeInAnimation 1.5s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInAnimation {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>